      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "we will login into our AWS account we will see Account id as we are root user, there is no IAM\nrelated stuff.\n\nIAM is a global service, its not region specific we can't select any region always global, \nEC2 can be a region specific service becuase on which particular region we are actually triggering our EC2.\n\n15:00",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "we will login into our AWS account we will see Account id as we are root user, there is no IAM\nrelated stuff.\n\nIAM is a global service, its not region specific we can't select any region always global, \nEC2 can be a region specific service becuase on which particular region we are actually triggering our EC2.\n\n15:00",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
