      "seed": 1013325565,
      "version": 27,
      "versionNonce": 642862163,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785422397890,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "After today, you'll understand what actually happens when you run:\npython app.py\nor\ndocker run nginx\nor\ngunicorn app:app\n\n\nDay 3 Roadmap (1 Hour)\n\n| Time   | Topic              |\n| ------ | ------------------ |\n| 10 min | Program vs Process |\n| 15 min | Process Creation   |\n| 15 min | PID & PPID         |\n| 10 min | Process Tree       |\n| 10 min | Hands-on Lab       |\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "After today, you'll understand what actually happens when you run:\npython app.py\nor\ndocker run nginx\nor\ngunicorn app:app\n\n\nDay 3 Roadmap (1 Hour)\n\n| Time   | Topic              |\n| ------ | ------------------ |\n| 10 min | Program vs Process |\n| 15 min | Process Creation   |\n| 15 min | PID & PPID         |\n| 10 min | Process Tree       |\n| 10 min | Hands-on Lab       |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LNsQjatX_NgKLk-Ok8R-Z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1989.8334733576967,
      "y": 11478.77340409308,
      "width": 297,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
