      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785422412585,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Part 1 - What is a Program?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Part 1 - What is a Program?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "mv0G2MEfdoPX1dKv-Gqil",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2068.9467546076967,
      "y": 11519.13668534308,
      "width": 638,
      "height": 675,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bIN",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1373940061,
      "version": 49,
      "versionNonce": 940857971,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785422534829,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Let's start with a simple question.\nYou write a Python file:\n    print(\"Hello\")\nSave it as: hello.py\n\nQuestion: Is hello.py a process?\nNo.\n\nIt's just a file stored on disk.\nThink of a program like a recipe book.\nA recipe book doesn't cook food.\nSomeone has to read it and start cooking.\nSimilarly, a program doesn't execute itself.\n\nDefinition\nA program is a passive set of instructions stored on disk.\n\nExamples:\npython\nnginx\ndocker\nkubectl\nmysqld\nhello.py\n\nThey're all just files.\nNothing is running yet.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Let's start with a simple question.\nYou write a Python file:\n    print(\"Hello\")\nSave it as: hello.py\n\nQuestion: Is hello.py a process?\nNo.\n\nIt's just a file stored on disk.\nThink of a program like a recipe book.\nA recipe book doesn't cook food.\nSomeone has to read it and start cooking.\nSimilarly, a program doesn't execute itself.\n\nDefinition\nA program is a passive set of instructions stored on disk.\n\nExamples:\npython\nnginx\ndocker\nkubectl\nmysqld\nhello.py\n\nThey're all just files.\nNothing is running yet.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rkqpIaaVLZOfCBFEMLScp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1983.3803483576967,
      "y": 12293.95309159308,
      "width": 297,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bIO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 416680179,
      "version": 35,
      "versionNonce": 1507981629,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785422554435,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Part 2 - What is a Process?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Part 2 - What is a Process?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DyLyMBi6JiCmn9MP0OM6e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2041.0795671076967,
      "y": 12333.96090409308,
      "width": 880,
      "height": 975,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bIP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 641539155,
      "version": 251,
      "versionNonce": 934646941,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785422801468,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now you run:\n    python hello.py\nNow something is executing.\nThis is called a process.\n\nDefinition:\nA process is a program that is currently being executed by the operating system.\n\nReal-Life Analogy\nImagine Microsoft Word.\nWhen installed: Microsoft Word.exe\nIt's just a program.\n\nWhen we double-click it:\n    Microsoft Word.exe -> Running Word Window\n\nThat's a process.\n\nOpen Word again:\n    Word Window 1\n    Word Window 2\nNow there are two processes running the same program.\nSame executable.\nDifferent processes.\n\n\nMultiple Processes\nSuppose you have: python app.py\nOpen another terminal.\nRun: python app.py\n\nNow Linux creates another process.\napp.py -> Process A PID 4201\napp.py -> Process B PID 4307\n\nSame program.\nDifferent memory.\nDifferent CPU time.\nDifferent Process ID.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now you run:\n    python hello.py\nNow something is executing.\nThis is called a process.\n\nDefinition:\nA process is a program that is currently being executed by the operating system.\n\nReal-Life Analogy\nImagine Microsoft Word.\nWhen installed: Microsoft Word.exe\nIt's just a program.\n\nWhen we double-click it:\n    Microsoft Word.exe -> Running Word Window\n\nThat's a process.\n\nOpen Word again:\n    Word Window 1\n    Word Window 2\nNow there are two processes running the same program.\nSame executable.\nDifferent processes.\n\n\nMultiple Processes\nSuppose you have: python app.py\nOpen another terminal.\nRun: python app.py\n\nNow Linux creates another process.\napp.py -> Process A PID 4201\napp.py -> Process B PID 4307\n\nSame program.\nDifferent memory.\nDifferent CPU time.\nDifferent Process ID.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CyiSOLIp9UqotSiCfH15z",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1987.8334733576967,
      "y": 13366.77340409308,
      "width": 198,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bIQ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 926083219,
      "version": 4,
      "versionNonce": 1914482035,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785422815571,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Interview Question",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Interview Question",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "nm-22X7xP13BmL1K74LhI",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2027.9545671076967,
      "y": 13396.77340409308,
      "width": 605,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bIR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1233642589,
      "version": 8,
      "versionNonce": 112246077,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785422832491,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What is the difference between a Program and a Process?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What is the difference between a Program and a Process?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UaKXryoc55xP1QKCRID--",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2078.8334733576967,
      "y": 13420.77340409308,
      "width": 649,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bIS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1425905747,
      "version": 7,
      "versionNonce": 528775955,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785422845196,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Excellent answer:\n\n| Program                 | Process                       |\n| ----------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| Stored on disk          | Running in memory             |\n| Passive                 | Active                        |\n| Static                  | Dynamic                       |\n| No CPU usage            | Uses CPU                      |\n| No memory allocated     | Has memory allocated          |\n| Can have many processes | Each process has a unique PID |\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Excellent answer:\n\n| Program                 | Process                       |\n| ----------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| Stored on disk          | Running in memory             |\n| Passive                 | Active                        |\n| Static                  | Dynamic                       |\n| No CPU usage            | Uses CPU                      |\n| No memory allocated     | Has memory allocated          |\n| Can have many processes | Each process has a unique PID |\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
