      "updated": 1785423491425,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Part 5 - Parent Process (PPID)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Part 5 - Parent Process (PPID)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "woMAvK0kDX7hg1DVM9q2i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1975.1381608576967,
      "y": 16652.43356034308,
      "width": 506,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bIb",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1882643645,
      "version": 116,
      "versionNonce": 1154210131,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785423572626,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Processes don't usually appear out of nowhere.\nMost processes are created by another process.\n\nTerminal -> bash -> python app.py\n\nHere:\n    bash creates the Python process.\nSo bash is parent, python is child\n\n\nThe Python process records:\n    PPID = bash PID\n\nThat's why ps -ef shows:\nPID, PPID",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Processes don't usually appear out of nowhere.\nMost processes are created by another process.\n\nTerminal -> bash -> python app.py\n\nHere:\n    bash creates the Python process.\nSo bash is parent, python is child\n\n\nThe Python process records:\n    PPID = bash PID\n\nThat's why ps -ef shows:\nPID, PPID",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
