    {
      "id": "WCAskms4qT_VRSM4TgwK4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1979.2201921076967,
      "y": 17625.56246659308,
      "width": 539,
      "height": 725,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bIf",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1008972317,
      "version": 97,
      "versionNonce": 1096620019,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785423795459,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step 1\nCreate a simple script.\n\nimport time\n\nwhile True:\n    print(\"Running...\")\n    time.sleep(5)\n\nSave as: process_demo.py\n\nStep 2 RUN it python process_demo.py\nLeave it running.\n\n\nStep 3\nOpen another terminal.\n\nRun:\n    ps -ef | grep process_demo\n    Observe the output.\n    Can you identify the PID?\n\n\nStep 4\n\nFind the process tree (if available):\n    pstree or pstree -p\n    This displays the parent-child relationships.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step 1\nCreate a simple script.\n\nimport time\n\nwhile True:\n    print(\"Running...\")\n    time.sleep(5)\n\nSave as: process_demo.py\n\nStep 2 RUN it python process_demo.py\nLeave it running.\n\n\nStep 3\nOpen another terminal.\n\nRun:\n    ps -ef | grep process_demo\n    Observe the output.\n    Can you identify the PID?\n\n\nStep 4\n\nFind the process tree (if available):\n    pstree or pstree -p\n    This displays the parent-child relationships.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Vo1d0R9wUiANG4E-hl3OJ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1988.9506608576967,
