    {
      "id": "F009ISNDylKxvdFVkXxNu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2014.9740983576967,
      "y": 18488.30465409308,
      "width": 759,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bIh",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 384705203,
      "version": 29,
      "versionNonce": 1350531613,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785423854928,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Run :  sleep 300\n\nThis creates a process that does nothing except wait for 300 seconds.\nNow inspect it:\n\nps -ef | grep sleep\n\nQuestions:\n\nWhat is its PID?\nWhat is its PPID?\nWho created it?\nWhy is it still running?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Run :  sleep 300\n\nThis creates a process that does nothing except wait for 300 seconds.\nNow inspect it:\n\nps -ef | grep sleep\n\nQuestions:\n\nWhat is its PID?\nWhat is its PPID?\nWho created it?\nWhy is it still running?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "jbST8KrCe6WYJaa-lfYr9",
