    {
      "id": "T1ecLIj5_OSBp8cwU7wn0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000.7084733576967,
      "y": 18997.64840409308,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 775,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bIj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 876453565,
      "version": 19,
      "versionNonce": 791093747,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785424082916,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Before Running\n\nSSD\n│\n├── python executable\n├── app.py\n└── data.txt\n\nNothing is in memory.\n\nAfter Running\n\nSSD\n│\n├── python executable\n├── app.py\n└── data.txt\n\n        │\n        ▼\n\nRAM\n│\n├── Python Process\n├── Variables\n├── Stack\n├── Heap\n└── Loaded Code\n\nCPU can execute only instructions that are in RAM.\nIt cannot execute directly from the SSD.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Before Running\n\nSSD\n│\n├── python executable\n├── app.py\n└── data.txt\n\nNothing is in memory.\n\nAfter Running\n\nSSD\n│\n├── python executable\n├── app.py\n└── data.txt\n\n        │\n        ▼\n\nRAM\n│\n├── Python Process\n├── Variables\n├── Stack\n├── Heap\n└── Loaded Code\n\nCPU can execute only instructions that are in RAM.\nIt cannot execute directly from the SSD.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "gilfqewqw4QWh-t7w2fw7",
      "type": "text",
